            <div>
                <span class="section-kicker">DATA STRUCTURES · 01–09</span>
                <h2>Build the storage model first.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Each card opens one real lab. The order matches the sidebar and the Next lesson navigation, so there is no hidden or grouped step in the learning path.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="path-grid module-grid">
            <a class="path-card available module-card" href="/structures/queue-stack">
                <div class="card-topline"><span class="path-index">01 · BEGINNER</span><span class="status-pill live"><i></i> Ready</span></div>
                <div class="path-icon linear-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <h3>Queue &amp; Stack</h3>
                <p>Start with LIFO, FIFO, stable IDs, linear search and manual dynamic-array storage.</p>
                <div class="concept-row"><span>LIFO</span><span>FIFO</span><span>Identity</span></div>
                <span class="card-link">Open lesson <b>→</b></span>
            </a>

            <a class="path-card available module-card" href="/structures/bst">
                <div class="card-topline"><span class="path-index">02 · BEGINNER</span><span class="status-pill live"><i></i> Ready</span></div>
                <div class="path-icon tree-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <h3>Binary Search Tree</h3>
                <p>Follow comparison paths, all delete cases, height changes and explicit DSW balancing.</p>
                <div class="concept-row"><span>O(h)</span><span>Delete</span><span>DSW</span></div>
                <span class="card-link">Open lesson <b>→</b></span>
            </a>

            <a class="path-card available module-card" href="/structures/binary-heap">
                <div class="card-topline"><span class="path-index">03 · BEGINNER+</span><span class="status-pill live"><i></i> Ready</span></div>
                <div class="path-icon tree-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <h3>Binary Heap</h3>
                <p>Connect complete-tree shape to array indexes, bubble-up and bubble-down.</p>
                <div class="concept-row"><span>d = 2</span><span>Min/Max</span><span>Indexes</span></div>
                <span class="card-link">Open lesson <b>→</b></span>
            </a>

            <a class="path-card available module-card" href="/structures/heap">
